    <!-- Introduction at the top of the screen. Keep "AdGuard ||domain^" as is: it is the rule syntax. -->
    <string name="feeds_intro">Hits on malware, phishing and C2 feeds raise high-severity alerts; tracking and ads lists only block. Enabled feeds are downloaded daily from their publishers (GitHub, abuse.ch, Spamhaus and others); turn a feed off to stop downloading it. Custom feeds accept hosts files, domain lists, AdGuard ||domain^ rules and IP/CIDR lists (for example a MISP text export with an API key in the Authorization header), JA4 fingerprint lists, and TAXII 2.1 collections (MISP, OpenCTI).</string>

